Z||000008||c m west||03-07-2001||07:25 PM||||But I am DEAD serious about building up a contender for street racing ( law enforcement folks just look the other way and dont read this ).,.....<P>I will use a motor that is readily accessable to me through the shop 3800 SC, 3.4 Quad Cam, Northstar, but not a small block - just too obvious.<P> will have the sound system to blow off competitors windows even though I am not a huge fan of music systems that can be heard in the next area code.<P> and it will have a major side of rice-ness to it by utilizing fuel management systems that are fully adjustable, turbo timer with turbo, full suspension with race spec camber ( -3 degrees in front, -2 in the rear ), adjustable spoiler - <P>...... if it is functional it will be on the car - ABSOLUTELY nothing for show....<P>.........soon...............<P>Eric - West Coast Fiero <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A> ||||reg||1
